    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Katana \u2014 The Ultimate Clicker Game for Sword Enthusiasts</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click. Collect. Repeat.<br>In <i>Katana</i>, every click brings you closer to building the greatest katana collection ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get a random katana every 3 hours</strong> and watch your collection grow with unique blades forged through community creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3-Hour Drop Rates*</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common \u2013 80%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncommon \u2013 16%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare \u2013 3%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic \u2013 0.99%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary \u2013 0.01%</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Drop rates are subject to change</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A katana. Obviously.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items to boost and expand your collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A community fully powered by katana passion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Submit your own designs via Discord!<br>Every katana in the game is inspired or created by players like you. Join the fun, leave your mark, and shape the future of <i>Katana</i>!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Katana \u2014 The Ultimate Clicker Game for Sword Enthusiasts</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click. Collect. Repeat.<br>In <i>Katana</i>, every click brings you closer to building the greatest katana collection ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get a random katana every 3 hours</strong> and watch your collection grow with unique blades forged through community creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3-Hour Drop Rates*</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common \u2013 80%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncommon \u2013 16%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare \u2013 3%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic \u2013 0.99%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary \u2013 0.01%</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Drop rates are subject to change</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A katana. Obviously.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items to boost and expand your collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A community fully powered by katana passion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Submit your own designs via Discord!<br>Every katana in the game is inspired or created by players like you. Join the fun, leave your mark, and shape the future of <i>Katana</i>!</p></li></ul>",
